Package: samplex
Title: Shiny Tool for Sample Size Calculation
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gustavo", "Ramirez-Valverde", , "gramirez@colpos.mx", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Benito", "Ramirez-Valverde", , "bramirez@colpos.mx", role = "aut")
  )
Description: An interactive 'shiny' application to assist in determining
    sample sizes for common survey designs such as 'simple random
    sampling', 'stratified sampling', and 'cluster sampling'. It includes
    formulas, helper calculators, and illustrative examples.
